<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Configuration on NaiNai</title><link>https://npujol.github.io/en/categories/configuration/</link><description>Recent Posts in Configuration on NaiNai</description><generator>Hugo 0.163.3</generator><language>en-GB</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 23:42:20 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://npujol.github.io/en/categories/configuration/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Configure Main Footer</title><link>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-main-footer/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><dc:creator>Nainai</dc:creator><guid>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-main-footer/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="main-footer-configuration"&gt;Main Footer Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main footer can be customized with your own content using the &lt;code&gt;footer&lt;/code&gt; type pages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="creating-footer-content"&gt;Creating Footer Content&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create markdown files with &lt;code&gt;type: 'footer'&lt;/code&gt; in your content directory:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;type: &amp;#39;footer&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;weight: 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;params:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; headless: true
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gs"&gt;**Impressum**&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="footer-menu"&gt;Footer Menu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add footer menu items in your menus configuration:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;footer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;identifier&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;about&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;About&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;url&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/about/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;footer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;identifier&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;contact&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Contact&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;url&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/contact/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="coffee-stat"&gt;Coffee Stat&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enable the coffee stat feature to show a &amp;ldquo;buy me a coffee&amp;rdquo; counter:&lt;/p&gt;</description><content:encoded>&lt;h2 id="main-footer-configuration"&gt;Main Footer Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main footer can be customized with your own content using the &lt;code&gt;footer&lt;/code&gt; type pages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="creating-footer-content"&gt;Creating Footer Content&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create markdown files with &lt;code&gt;type: 'footer'&lt;/code&gt; in your content directory:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;type: &amp;#39;footer&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;weight: 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;params:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; headless: true
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gs"&gt;**Impressum**&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="footer-menu"&gt;Footer Menu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add footer menu items in your menus configuration:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;footer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;identifier&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;about&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;About&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;url&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/about/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;footer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;identifier&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;contact&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Contact&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;url&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/contact/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="coffee-stat"&gt;Coffee Stat&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enable the coffee stat feature to show a &amp;ldquo;buy me a coffee&amp;rdquo; counter:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;coffeeStat&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;coffee&lt;/code&gt; parameter in footer pages controls the display:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;footer&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;coffee&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;headless&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content:encoded><category>Configuration</category></item><item><title>Configure Logo and Accent Color</title><link>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-logo-and-accent-color/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><dc:creator>Nainai</dc:creator><guid>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-logo-and-accent-color/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="logo-configuration"&gt;Logo Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The logo can be configured in two ways: as an image mark or as a type-based logo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="image-logo-mark"&gt;Image Logo Mark&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add the following to your &lt;code&gt;config.toml&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;logo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;logoMark&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;/img/logo.svg&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;logoMarkDark&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;/img/logo-dark.svg&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="type-based-logo"&gt;Type-based Logo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a text-based logo, set &lt;code&gt;logoType&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;logo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;logoType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This will display the site title as the logo with proper typography.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="accent-color"&gt;Accent Color&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The accent color is used for links, highlights, and interactive elements. Configure it in your theme&amp;rsquo;s style settings:&lt;/p&gt;</description><content:encoded>&lt;h2 id="logo-configuration"&gt;Logo Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The logo can be configured in two ways: as an image mark or as a type-based logo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="image-logo-mark"&gt;Image Logo Mark&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add the following to your &lt;code&gt;config.toml&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;logo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;logoMark&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;/img/logo.svg&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;logoMarkDark&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;/img/logo-dark.svg&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="type-based-logo"&gt;Type-based Logo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a text-based logo, set &lt;code&gt;logoType&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;logo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;logoType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This will display the site title as the logo with proper typography.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="accent-color"&gt;Accent Color&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The accent color is used for links, highlights, and interactive elements. Configure it in your theme&amp;rsquo;s style settings:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;light&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ac&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;#36c&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c"&gt;# Light mode accent&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;dark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ac&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;#fa0&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c"&gt;# Dark mode accent&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="color-options"&gt;Color Options&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ac&lt;/code&gt; — Accent color (links, buttons, highlights)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt; — Background color&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; — Foreground color (text)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;mid&lt;/code&gt; — Mid-tone color (secondary text, borders)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded><category>Configuration</category></item><item><title>Configure Menu</title><link>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-menu/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><dc:creator>Nainai</dc:creator><guid>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-menu/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="menu-configuration"&gt;Menu Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The menu in hugo-brewm is configured through the &lt;code&gt;menus&lt;/code&gt; configuration files. You can define menu items in &lt;code&gt;_default/menus.en.toml&lt;/code&gt; or similar language-specific files.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="example-configuration"&gt;Example Configuration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]]&lt;/span&gt;
