&lt;h3 id="multi-level-menus"&gt;Multi-level Menus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;hugo-brewm supports nested menus through the &lt;code&gt;parent&lt;/code&gt; parameter:&lt;/p&gt;</description><content:encoded>&lt;h2 id="menu-configuration"&gt;Menu Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
